      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਭੀਤੰ ॥੬੯॥",
      "transliteration": "namo sarab bheeta(n) ||69||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Universal Fear Lord! 69",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਭ ਨੂੰ ਭੈ ਦੇਣ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੬੯॥",
