      "sourceShabadId": "7407",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0004_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਰੰਗੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo sarab ra(n)ge ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O All-Colour Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਰਬ ਰੰਗ (ਆਨੰਦ) ਸਰੂਪ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 4,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो सरब रंगे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74490",
      "sourceShabadId": "7407",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0004_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਅਨੰਗੇ ॥੭੧॥",
      "transliteration": "tirabha(n)gee ana(n)ge ||71||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Three-World-Destroyer Lord! 71",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਤਿੰਨ ਲੋਕਾ ਦੇ ਸੰਘਾਰਕ ਅਤੇ ਨਿਰਾਕਾਰ ਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ) ॥੭੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 4,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तृभंगी अनंगे ॥७१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74491",
      "sourceShabadId": "7407",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0004_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਜੀਵ ਜੀਵੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo jeev jeeva(n) ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Universal-Life Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਜੀਵਾ ਦੇ ਜੀਵ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 4,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो जीव जीवं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74492",
      "sourceShabadId": "7407",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0004_line_0049",
      "lineIndex": 49,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਬੀਜ ਬੀਜੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo beej beeje ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Primal-Seed Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਬੀਜਾ ਦੇ ਬੀਜ (ਕਾਰਨ ਸਰੂਪ)! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 4,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो बीज बीजे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74493",
      "sourceShabadId": "7407",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0004_line_0050",
      "lineIndex": 50,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਖਿੱਜੇ ਅਭਿੱਜੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "akhi'je abhi'je ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Harmless Lord!  Salutation to Thee O Non-Appeaser Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਨਾ ਖਿਝਣ ਵਾਲੇ, ਨਾ ਭਿਜਣ ਵਾਲੇ (ਘੁਲ ਮਿਲ ਜਾਣ ਵਾਲੇ)",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 4,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अखिज्जे अभिज्जे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74494",
      "sourceShabadId": "7407",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0004_line_0051",
      "lineIndex": 51,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਮਸਤੰ ਪ੍ਰਸਿੱਜੇ ॥੭੨॥",
      "transliteration": "samasata(n) prasi'je ||72||",
